	"system": {
		"description": "<p>Some things are just easier with a mirror, like parting one’s hair or shooting through cover when someone’s right around a corner. As a bonus action, you can use a reflective surface as small as a monocle to negate cover or concealment. So long as you have clear line of sight to the mirror, and the mirror has clear line of sight to your target, you ignore cover and concealment on attacks against your target.</p>",
